<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 329-4 IN 2ND INNINGS V PAKISTAN - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 329-4 IN 2ND INNINGS V PAKISTAN - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, 39 runs ahead of Pakistan on first innings, were 329 for four in their second innings at tea on the fourth day of the second and final test on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 331 and 329-4, Pakistan 292.</p>
</text>
